'''E-797''' (主任看守セレブ, ''Shunin Kanshu'', '''Head Guard Celeb''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Celeboodle]] that appears in [[Anniversary/14th Year|14th Anniversary]] stages. It was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

