==Enemy==
A slightly weaker celeboodle with miniwave and debuffs. In higher crowns can be a huge threat if you dont have octopus or a way to burst into them quickly.

==Strategy==
Considering your "unfavorable" pool of units the only full counter is [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] due to their Wave Blocker.
If you cannot get them you might want to lure and hit them with a nuker unit (e.g. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]) to either cripple or kill then outright.

